      "source_text": "趁着太阳高挂的时候赶紧训练吧。\n要做的事情那么多，\n但时间却很少哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4076e9efce560a087b0086fa49788383b85651dcb750cf5915847994def73a2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a43d6737160ad6758e12bb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔哇？！怎么已经这时候了？！\n真的一眨眼就过去一天了啊。\n要是一天有48小时就好了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "91454be8ba34af02d69db2a55069dd4d5ba74811dc4c6d8a962e9581a7437e72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52a0afce9c8517afcb3eb354",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "差不多也该回去了吧。\n还得为明天的事情做准备呢，\n省得明天一大早就慌慌张张的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ffe4a897c46c27c7dad2c3464516b37b1854686c063c24c75314b2991707b5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0089c258ff80e1e71c6998a8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好烦啊，该怎么办呢…\n好想去春季甜品节玩啊…\n但要真去的了话也挺不妙的吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f89c12f6e1a604e9dd4288c34173e74a633727b5ca86a92705386c5b996a4f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614eecd6824ebf36b9c583d0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "涂防晒霜的方法还蛮多的。\n防晒霜不仅分为面部用和身体用，\n还得不厌其烦地反复涂抹呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fd7835116bdfe5e4835e12466178f31d0870754a4aee0d74e6c8da5d27e359",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
