        "1040",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4a65f4860c77076fc07f285",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个时期总是会出很多衣服啊！\n虽然没法把拍过广告的衣服全都买下\n来，但却是有不少中意的衣服啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e6639fed2840fe6d02cff4037af39b369f7321fea92087a7ad490fe1bfee750",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bc0f5e010fff5a4059b13f6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这啥啊不行！完全不行！\n啊…我说的是冬季新品的事情，\n没在说你啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8bea3315f67cef34fb65366ccf96a454abf0e7cb5b0b3f2672b191e9c5a859f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9bf00d2b303eeabcef3ba5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…我醒着的哦。穿着这么多东西\n真的很难睡…咕。\n…你什么都没看见，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0bcc9f454d62e0ca18bc4e345c85aa5271e95652fa87a3704e209350a51950",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66fee9d1f1cccb4f89879918",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要跳起舞来，脑袋就立马清醒了。\n果然生命在于运动啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f111f34ddc01a39dcae7e977e980c5a07e5bce3ae250cb49f03e8c6526ffc4c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029a800482823c48e58af21b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "穿着这身衣服吃东西还挺方便的呢。\n但我也许会太在意自己的行为举止，\n紧张到没法吃进嘴里去…",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed538ee5c396b4e089c49be7e8deb0fbd7b909e97eefcc6b4c321267f173de5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9412c06330cb2dc46fc58d37",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个时间的阳光很舒适呢…\n偶尔也放空大脑去散散步如何呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d066d231611c23ca61754dfba4b26f6592af93c743db6669ce5fe5fbfa5b8e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879ebee82c7bfdb825c360be",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总觉得大家在集训时特别闹腾啊。\n…我才没觉得寂寞哦。\n真没觉得寂寞。说了没有啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "651f624c9b48d71914caa06d02accab2ba1458d22d5f39f4cf94f65a59a3e609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b4b596b0275f9ab14009b62",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有时睡不着的时候会去神社转转。\n夜晚的神社真的非常幽静呢…\n感觉自己从内到外都焕然一新了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9eabf43be771305457e665c4e3d5a61cdade1bef59f96ca105eccf496b1f0a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64532d8a7b034d87b1a786e2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "花和团子，你更喜欢团子吗？\n但要是说我就是“花”的话…\n…这里可是笑点啊。真是的…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fe7f0ea85cb9b53841147ebbde5b4d718949217284e8285bb9c48cd70a5e4d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06bde6b205db380d5261be02",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊…要不要再买把扇子呢。\n就买把紫色的吧，和比赛很搭啊。\n和我的衣服也很配吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5806e7bc304a36870eb268fb3f9f1d5ab3d909a36bf3e12df2a37cd59ec63242",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f417cb239386db43eccc11c3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏天和秋天的祭典气氛截然呢。\n虽然不太喜欢去人多的地方，\n但是秋天天气比较凉爽，应该还能接受吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e5fa46a6bdd48390d83fee2f4dddced15517b591baf42da2057c7f7191e6eaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:746cd90a91998bd6f09cd493",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…嘿嘿。啊抱歉，想起了有趣的事。\n阿雪用雪堆了一致白兔子出来，\n那双又白又圆的眼睛很可爱呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdcfb275df5858a90ae2d0c5d3b60e5902d1610b214bdd52b267faa4e957ae57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1040/90019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d4a0f1f550e72e8e229f6ef",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
